      "id": "2121405419851821252",
      "text": "Noteworthy, again, that every Pacer but Jarace Walker has seen the court tonight. 11 players already, including two-way F Jalen Slawson. We've seen Carlisle visibly frustrated in recent games. And a guy like Slawson plays hard and makes the right play. How will JW respond?",
